      "title": "Southern Company Data Breach Investigation: Edelson Lechtzin LLP Probes Class Action Claims After Customer Data Is Exposed",
      "summary": "Edelson Lechtzin LLP is investigating a class action lawsuit against Southern Company following a data breach affecting approximately 400,000 customer accounts across Georgia Power, Alabama Power, and Mississippi Power. An unauthorized third party accessed limited customer account information including names, addresses, phone numbers, email addresses, and partial Social Security numbers. The law firm is offering free case evaluations to affected customers.",
